{"4662170": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Larva", "steam_appid": 4662170, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>LARVA is a tactical co-op horror FPS for up to 4 players. Drop into procedurally generated environments crawling with deadly anomalies. Scavenge for valuable loot, watch each other's backs, and extract before the horrors overwhelm you. Every run is different. Every sound matters. Trust no room.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4662170/extras/7bf2e48918960fb1ac8632b9cc0d7612.webp?t=1786965586\" width=780 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4662170/extras/15d3c6a181f3da21e596bcebd160eb91.poster.avif?t=1786965586\" width=1170 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4662170/extras/15d3c6a181f3da21e596bcebd160eb91.webm?t=1786965586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4662170/extras/15d3c6a181f3da21e596bcebd160eb91.mp4?t=1786965586\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each session generates a unique layout filled with dark corridors, sealed rooms, and hidden passages. No map, no safety net - just your flashlight and your instincts. Learn to read your surroundings, or get lost in them.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4662170/extras/b630254a0e768832553ee56c770f5b7d.webp?t=1786965586\" width=780 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4662170/extras/6a4a5423da6d9d93361fee2fbaeb853a.poster.avif?t=1786965586\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4662170/extras/6a4a5423da6d9d93361fee2fbaeb853a.webm?t=1786965586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4662170/extras/6a4a5423da6d9d93361fee2fbaeb853a.mp4?t=1786965586\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Communication is your greatest weapon. Coordinate with your squad, call out threats, share supplies, and cover every angle. Splitting up might cover more ground - but it might also be the last thing you do.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4662170/extras/7c3feca41c8cde7304687f5e38b78067.webp?t=1786965586\" width=780 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4662170/extras/61336ddc07692b41c407fdfe55325ce4.poster.avif?t=1786965586\" width=1170 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4662170/extras/61336ddc07692b41c407fdfe55325ce4.webm?t=1786965586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4662170/extras/61336ddc07692b41c407fdfe55325ce4.mp4?t=1786965586\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The environments are infested with deadly anomalies - each with unique behaviors and weaknesses. Some stalk you in silence. Others charge without warning. Study them, adapt, and strike when the moment is right.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4662170/extras/127b3d2fa208dae21535f3bcb4308325.webp?t=1786965586\" width=780 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge valuable items scattered throughout each run. The deeper you go, the better the loot - but the greater the danger. Know when to push forward and when to get out. Greed kills.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4662170/extras/7f6d958aabf17945d071d9c74ee06b0c.avif?t=1786965586\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>LARVA is a tactical co-op horror FPS for up to 4 players. Drop into procedurally generated environments crawling with deadly anomalies. Scavenge for valuable loot, watch each other's backs, and extract before the horrors overwhelm you. Every run is different. Every sound matters. Trust no room.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4662170/extras/7bf2e48918960fb1ac8632b9cc0d7612.webp?t=1786965586\" width=780 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4662170/extras/15d3c6a181f3da21e596bcebd160eb91.poster.avif?t=1786965586\" width=1170 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4662170/extras/15d3c6a181f3da21e596bcebd160eb91.webm?t=1786965586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4662170/extras/15d3c6a181f3da21e596bcebd160eb91.mp4?t=1786965586\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each session generates a unique layout filled with dark corridors, sealed rooms, and hidden passages. No map, no safety net - just your flashlight and your instincts. Learn to read your surroundings, or get lost in them.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4662170/extras/b630254a0e768832553ee56c770f5b7d.webp?t=1786965586\" width=780 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4662170/extras/6a4a5423da6d9d93361fee2fbaeb853a.poster.avif?t=1786965586\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4662170/extras/6a4a5423da6d9d93361fee2fbaeb853a.webm?t=1786965586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4662170/extras/6a4a5423da6d9d93361fee2fbaeb853a.mp4?t=1786965586\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Communication is your greatest weapon. Coordinate with your squad, call out threats, share supplies, and cover every angle. Splitting up might cover more ground - but it might also be the last thing you do.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4662170/extras/7c3feca41c8cde7304687f5e38b78067.webp?t=1786965586\" width=780 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn